 that could wake up your child.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Automatic Silent Mode - Mute all Notification On your child\u2019s station Device.\r\nYour baby will not be awakened by an undue message or call. After turning off the Saby Baby Monitor, it will go into silent mode.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Aware of Battery - Get a notification when it get to 20% battery left.\r\nThe app shows how much charge remains on the baby station device, and it notifies you when the charge lessens to 20%.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Full log of Recent Sleeps.\r\nIt is always useful to analyze your child\u2019s past sleeps. You can use this information to discover the most suitable time to put your child to bed.\r\n\r\nNow it's easy to monitor your baby, with Saby Baby Cam. Wifi Video Nanny By Saby.\r\n\r\nYou can find our Privacy Policy here: https://saby.app/privacy-policy/",
